Data note

The MIT license covers the code, the schema, the skills, and our own analysis
text. It does not cover the launch videos, the posts they link to, the short
excerpts quoted from those posts, or company names and marks, which belong to
their owners. Metrics are public counts as reported on the date shown in each
record. They are facts recorded with a link to the source post and come with
no warranty. Owners can ask for a record to be corrected or removed by opening
an issue.
